291 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 260 0 R
/E (In 2006, he founded Elite Technologies, starting with door-to-door installations and gradually growing into advanced automation systems for homes and corporate environments. This is where he learned how people truly interact with technology. From simple touch panels to controlling thousands of programmed circuits across lighting, audio, security, and boardroom systems, the focus was always the same. Technology had to be usable, reliable, and make sense to the person using it. It was never about building something complicated. It was about taking complex systems and making them feel simple, seamless, and dependable. This is where the first discipline was developed :)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
